---
title: Example · state transitions
config:
  look: handDrawn
  handDrawnSeed: 5
  theme: dark
  themeVariables:
    mainBkg: "#333333"
    edgeLabelBackground: "#1f1f1f"
    noteBkgColor: "#333333"
  themeCSS: |
    small { color: #b3b3b3; display: inline-block; text-align: left; }
---
%% Owning document: <domain>.md.
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  state "Idle" as Idle
  state "Running<br/><small>the key state is em</small>" as Running
  state "Done" as Done

  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Running : request accepted
  Running --> Done : success
  Running --> Idle : failure<br/>[retryable]
  Done --> [*]

  note right of Running
    • one bullet per statement
    • notes follow the same rule
  end note

  classDef em fill:#173d25,stroke:#86efac
  class Running em
